<title>UK: RJB to buy 5 pct of shares for cancellation.</title>
<headline>RJB to buy 5 pct of shares for cancellation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British coal mining group RJB Mining Plc said on Wednesday it instructed BZW Securities Ltd as its agent to buy back up to 8,560,000 of its ordinary shares for cancellation.</p>
<p>RJB said the shares represented five percent of its issued share capital as of May 21, 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
